{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["Therefore YHWH blessed the Sabbath day — as I explained in Genesis. 'Therefore' — that He blessed the Sabbath day — means: when the Sabbath day arrived, the Holy One, blessed be He, had already created everything the creatures need and their food, and so the Sabbath turned out blessed with every good thing. And therefore 'and hallowed it' — to rest on it as a testimony, just as the Holy One, blessed be He, rested: He first created everything and afterward rested."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:13.233842819Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}